.jpg\"/></div><h2 class=\"font-bold text-base group-hover:text-[var(--color-primary)] transition-colors\">Sarah Chen</h2><p class=\"text-xs text-[var(--color-muted-fg)] mt-2 line-clamp-2\">Horticulturist and garden designer specializing in native plants and eco-friendly landscaping.</p></a><a class=\"group flex flex-col items-center text-center p-6 bg-white border border-[var(--color-border)] rounded-xl hover:shadow-md hover:border-[var(--color-primary)] transition-all\" href=\"/authors/mike-rodriguez\"><div class=\"relative w-20 h-20 rounded-full overflow-hidden mb-4 bg-[var(--color-muted)]\"><img alt=\"Mike Rodriguez\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" data-nimg=\"fill\" class=\"object-cover\" style=\"position:absolute;height:100%;width:100%;left:0;top:0;right:0;bottom:0;color:transparent\" src=\"https://s.alicdn.com/@sc02/kf/Ac6ea9d68e56b4e68b264a1982dc19a8cG.jpg\"/></div><h2 class=\"font-bold text-base group-hover:text-[var(--color-primary)] transition-colors\">Mike Rodriguez</h2><p class=\"text-xs text-[var(--color-muted-fg)] mt-2 line-clamp-2\">Professional landscaper and pest control specialist with expertise in integrated pest management.</p></a><a class=\"group flex flex-col items-center text-center p-6 bg-white border border-[var(--color-border)] rounded-xl hover:shadow-md hover:border-[var(--color-primary)] transition-all\" href=\"/authors/emily-watson\"><div class=\"relative w-20 h-20 rounded-full overflow-hidden mb-4 bg-[var(--color-muted)]\"><img alt=\"Emily Watson\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" data-nimg=\"fill\" class=\"object-cover\" style=\"position:absolute;height:100%;width:100%;left:0;top:0;right:0;bottom:0;color:transparent\" src=\"https://s.alicdn.com/@sc02/kf/Ae428aca9de0f4492b62692c978f316edd.jpg\"/></div><h2 class=\"font-bold text-base group-hover:text-[var(--color-primary)] transition-colors\">Emily Watson</h2><p class=\"text-xs text-[var(--color-muted-fg)] mt-2 line-clamp-2\">Certified arborist and tree care specialist focused on urban forestry and tree health.</p></a><a class=\"group flex flex-col items-center text-center p-6 bg-white border border-[var(--color-border)] rounded-xl hover:shadow-md hover:border-[var(--color-primary)] transition-all\" href=\"/authors/david-park\"><div class=\"relative w-20 h-20 rounded-full overflow-hidden mb-4 bg-[var(--color-muted)]\"><img alt=\"David Park\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" data-nimg=\"fill\" class=\"object-cover\" style=\"position:absolute;height:100%;width:100%;left:0;top:0;right:0;bottom:0;color:transparent\" src=\"https://s.alicdn.com/@sc02/kf/Af117fdf675394293b243aa5f0fc58bb6f.jpg\"/></div><h2 class=\"font-bold text-base group-hover:text-[var(--color-primary)] transition-colors\">David Park</h2><p class=\"text-xs text-[var(--color-muted-fg)] mt-2 line-clamp-2\">Vegetable gardening enthusiast and soil science expert with a passion for organic growing.</p></a><a class=\"group flex flex-col items-center text-center p-6 bg-white border border-[var(--color-border)] rounded-xl hover:shadow-md hover:border-[var(--color-primary)] transition-all\" href=\"/authors/lisa-thompson\"><div class=\"relative w-20 h-20 rounded-full overflow-hidden mb-4 bg-[var(--color-muted)]\"><img alt=\"Lisa Thompson\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" data-nimg=\"fill\" class=\"object-cover\" style=\"position:absolute;height:100%;width:100%;left:0;top:0;right:0;bottom:0;color:transparent\" src=\"https://s.alicdn.com/@sc02/kf/A9681ff1938eb4289b6f6f50e3120f2beX.jpg\"/></div><h2 class=\"font-bold text-base group-hover:text-[var(--color-primary)] transition-colors\">Lisa Thompson</h2><p class=\"text-xs text-[var(--color-muted-fg)] mt-2 line-clamp-2\">Home garden designer helping homeowners create beautiful, low-maintenance outdoor spaces.</p></a><a class=\"group flex flex-col items-center text-center p-6 bg-white border border-[var(--color-border)] rounded-xl hover:shadow-md hover:border-[var(--color-primary)] transition-all\" href=\"/authors/robert-hayes\"><div cla